                "severity": "WARNING",
                "claim": "Candidate.Short slices Head[:12] without a length check. The doc comment says the zero Candidate names nothing, but calling Short on it panics. ResultName, WorktreePath, NextNumber and Handoff all go through Short or Ref, so they inherit this. NewCandidate guarantees a valid head, so only a caller that ignores the error and uses the zero value hits it. No test covers that case.",
