                ]
              }
            ],
            "evidence": [
              "I read all 10 changed paths in full.",
              "NewCandidate is covered for abbreviated, uppercase, empty and mixed-length names, and for empty, duplicate and non-UTF-8 paths. It is also covered for the empty-paths-as-array case and for the digest and size of the diff.",
              "NextNumber is tested at the 9-digit boundary. A launch number of 10 or more digits is ignored, so the next number would restart at 1 and could reuse a name. That needs a billion launches of one head, which is out of domain, so I did not report it.",
              "EncodeResult, Handoff and ParentFields are tested through externally observable parsing: the stored JSON and roles.ParseRoleHandoff."
